      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the given <a href=\"PropertyReferenceException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>PropertyReferenceException</code></a> has a deeper resolution depth (i.e. a longer path of\nalready resolved properties) than the current exception.",
      "translation": "判断给定的<a href=\"PropertyReferenceException.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.core 中的类\"><code>PropertyReferenceException</code></a>的解析深度是否比当前异常更深（即已解析属性的路径更长）。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the name of the property not found.",
      "translation": "返回未找到属性的名称。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the type the property could not be found on.",
      "translation": "返回该属性无法找到的类型。",
      "count": 3
