      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>propertyName</code> - the name of the property not found on the given type, must not be null or empty.</dd>\n<dd><code>type</code> - the type the property could not be found on, must not be null.</dd>\n<dd><code>alreadyResolvedPath</code> - the previously calculated <a href=\"PropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>PropertyPath</code></a>s, must not be null.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>propertyName</code> - 在给定类型中未找到的属性名称，不能为 null 或空。</dd>\n<dd><code>type</code> - 无法找到该属性的类型，不能为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>alreadyResolvedPath</code> - 先前计算出的 <a href=\"PropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>PropertyPath</code></a>，不能为 null。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
